],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fy4AG0M9fIN2QqgRvihxNw","review_id":"XGQGWakEK19lS0cjGh1tSg","date":"2017-08-30T15:50:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9078717231750488,"text_excerpt":"Mangosteen smoothie really had me at first sip, very refreshing on these hot summer days"},{"business_id":"fy4AG0M9fIN2QqgRvihxNw","review_id":"Px3KUgYL6tSr4vZmw7cWfg","date":"2018-03-18T22:10:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9025987982749939,"text_excerpt":"Served as a great, quick plant-based breakfast on the go. I've been to a few Smoothie Kings before while traveling the country and this was the best one I've been to yet! It was super convenient located just a half a block from our hotel, Hotel Monteleone and was a great detox after a night of drinking. I appreciate the vegan and kid options, and the add ins! Fun! This visit I opted for the pineapple spinach with Sun Warrior protein powder minus the Stevia because it seemed unnecessary. The smoothie was super creamy and filling. It was fresh, made quickly and delicious! They have a bunch of other healthy grab and go items also! Happy to say the city that has a stadium with the same name s..."},{"business_id":"fy4AG0M9fIN2QqgRvihxNw","review_id":"fa8OH_4zJ0K4er-_wHDWkw","date":"2017-04-04T01:57:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.894461989402771,"text_excerpt":"As an out-of-towner, I got to experience the joy of discovering Smoothie King for the first time--and I was so impressed I'm now hoping that they will eventually expand to California! I'm hooked, and I don't know how I'll survive until my next visit to NOLA. My favorite (and possibly the most delicious concoction I've ever tried) was the Island Impact. They do customizations, so I subtracted the protein powder and added strawberries. The result reminded me very much of Juice Shack's best offering, the now tragically discontinued Papaya Swirl. In any case, you know something is damn good when you're compelled to go back for seconds only two days later. My return just happened to be on a Mo..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
